WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:08.070
<b><i>Ah, simply thinking of that person
makes my heart falter into a thousand pieces.</i></b>

00:08.070 --> 00:14.490
<b><i>Your Highness, what agonizes you so?
Tomorrow is your coronation.</i></b>

00:14.490 --> 00:17.620
<b><i>That... Do not speak of that.</i></b>

00:17.740 --> 00:19.490
<b><i>So this is where you were.</i></b>

00:19.490 --> 00:22.040
<b><i>I thought you were dead.</i></b>

00:22.040 --> 00:24.960
<b><i>The songstress is mine.</i></b>

00:24.960 --> 00:26.290
<b><i>Please escape.</i></b>

00:26.290 --> 00:27.590
<b><i>You won't escape.</i></b>

00:27.590 --> 00:29.840
<b><i>I'll strike you down.</i></b>

00:36.760 --> 00:40.260
<b><i>True love is mine.</i></b>

00:41.310 --> 00:42.890
<b><i>Tomorrow is sunny.</i></b>

00:42.980 --> 00:45.020
<b><i>Tasty. Tasty.</i></b>

00:45.140 --> 00:48.270
<b><i>Will you take a bath?
Or will you eat a meal?</i></b>

00:48.360 --> 00:51.480
<b><i>Will you take a bath?
Or will you eat a meal?</i></b>

00:51.610 --> 00:54.860
<b><i>Will you take a bath?
Or will you eat a meal?</i></b>

02:36.880 --> 02:37.510
<b>Okay!</b>

02:37.760 --> 02:38.380
<b>Here.</b>

02:38.720 --> 02:40.180
<b>Now, drink up.</b>

02:40.180 --> 02:43.350
<b>You can't drink Terran water
this fresh in the Bunker.</b>

02:43.760 --> 02:45.560
<b>Come on, take a swill.</b>

02:45.560 --> 02:46.970
<b>I have no need.</b>

02:47.430 --> 02:50.980
<b>Come on, what is it?
You can't drink my water?</b>

02:50.980 --> 02:56.980
<b>I’m sorry. We YoRHa units automatically
replenish water from our internal tanks.</b>

02:57.150 --> 03:00.860
<b>I see. You guys
have really convenient bodies.</b>

03:00.860 --> 03:02.820
<b>However, we will accept your sentiment.</b>

03:04.580 --> 03:06.790
<b>That means this so-called tank...</b>

03:07.040 --> 03:09.040
<b>Quietly approach...</b>

03:09.210 --> 03:10.410
<b>and squeeze.</b>

03:10.660 --> 03:12.420
<b>What are you doing?</b>

03:12.670 --> 03:16.460
<b>- Where is it attached? Come on, come on.
- S-Stop that!</b>

03:16.460 --> 03:18.840
<b>Jackass, that’s enough.</b>

03:18.840 --> 03:20.010
<b>Boo.</b>

03:21.010 --> 03:23.970
<b>So, what did you guys see?</b>

03:25.510 --> 03:26.470
<b>We...</b>

03:27.180 --> 03:30.100
<b>followed a special unit we found in the desert.</b>

03:30.180 --> 03:33.060
<b>It led us to a place where we confirmed
countless android corpses.</b>

03:33.650 --> 03:35.650
<b>The machine lifeforms...</b>

03:36.230 --> 03:37.690
<b>It was their doing.</b>

03:38.280 --> 03:41.070
<b>Then, we were caught in a collapse.</b>

03:42.450 --> 03:44.820
<b>Two mutants? Simultaneously?</b>

03:45.200 --> 03:48.790
<b>Yes. It was a type
we've never seen before.</b>

03:48.910 --> 03:50.540
<b>And were you able to defeat them?</b>

03:50.830 --> 03:55.920
<b>No, unfortunately. We uploaded the combat data
to the Bunker where it's currently being analyzed.</b>

03:56.290 --> 03:59.920
<b>That machine lifeform
looked just like an android.</b>

04:01.300 --> 04:05.800
<b>I wish I saw that wonderful sample
with my own eyes.</b>

04:05.800 --> 04:09.220
<b>It was evolving at tremendous speed
from the moment it emerged.</b>

04:09.220 --> 04:11.520
<b>Furthermore, it was capable of speaking words.</b>

04:11.520 --> 04:14.770
<b>It was simply mimicking a human.</b>

04:15.020 --> 04:18.900
<b>But in due time, it might end up
becoming a being that surpasses humanity.</b>

04:19.110 --> 04:21.070
<b>That's going too far, Jackass.</b>

04:21.070 --> 04:24.660
<b>Lately, machine lifeforms
have been clearly changing.</b>

04:25.070 --> 04:29.910
<b>Perhaps we might be able to negotiate
in some way. There is precedence.</b>

04:30.040 --> 04:31.120
<b>Precedence?</b>

04:31.500 --> 04:36.460
<b>Even if we could understand,
our existences are irreconcilable after all.</b>

04:36.630 --> 04:39.460
<b>We might be able
to find a path for a ceasefire.</b>

04:39.460 --> 04:40.710
<b>A ceasefire?</b>

04:40.840 --> 04:43.840
<b>Such a thing won't reclaim this planet for us.</b>

04:44.130 --> 04:45.340
<b>Besides...</b>

04:45.510 --> 04:46.340
<b>Besides?</b>

04:46.800 --> 04:51.350
<b>All of our allies who’ve died...
What have they been fighting for?</b>

04:51.350 --> 04:53.230
<b>What did they believe in?</b>

04:53.230 --> 04:55.440
<b>Those reasons will all disappear.</b>

04:55.900 --> 04:58.610
<b>The mission given to us androids</b>

04:58.610 --> 05:03.860
<b>is to destroy machine lifeforms for humanity
and regain control of Earth.</b>

05:04.030 --> 05:08.620
<b>How much longer will you fight this war
that’s continued for several thousand years?</b>

05:10.780 --> 05:11.990
<b>Until...</b>

05:12.910 --> 05:14.870
<b>every last one of them has been destroyed.</b>

05:17.670 --> 05:21.880
<b>In any case, we can only do
what we are supposed to do for now.</b>

05:22.000 --> 05:23.550
<b>This conversation is over.</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:28.010
<b>We androids who simply follow orders,</b>

05:28.010 --> 05:32.060
<b>and machine lifeforms that are starting
to want freedom, huh?</b>

05:34.060 --> 05:39.440
<b>We androids were modeled
after our human creators.</b>

05:39.520 --> 05:43.320
<b>So why would machine lifeforms
try to mimic us?</b>

05:43.820 --> 05:47.240
<b>There's no point trying to work out
unsolvable problems.</b>

05:47.400 --> 05:49.530
<b>I suppose.</b>

06:10.140 --> 06:13.560
<b>This is Commander White
of Satellite Orbit Base Bunker.</b>

06:13.720 --> 06:15.850
<b>Concerning the operation
currently underway,</b>

06:15.850 --> 06:19.980
<b>it is difficult to continue
with just 2B and 9S after all.</b>

06:20.150 --> 06:22.020
<b>Data collection will prove
to be difficult unless we—</b>

06:22.020 --> 06:23.230
<b><i>Commander.</i></b>

06:23.900 --> 06:29.610
<b><i>As we have said multiple times, we cannot
approve your requests for backup.</i></b>

06:30.030 --> 06:34.370
<b><i>Use the Resistance onsite as decoys
and execute your mission.</i></b>

06:34.580 --> 06:39.250
<b>However, if we don't do something, not only
the Resistance decoys, but 2B and 9S will—</b>

06:39.250 --> 06:44.630
<b><i>The special machine lifeform units
encountered last week, Adam and Eve,</i></b>

06:44.630 --> 06:49.470
<b><i>and all unique machine lifeform units
that you will contact in the future,</i></b>

06:49.470 --> 06:52.970
<b><i>are all embedded within the plan
of Project YoRHa.</i></b>

06:53.300 --> 06:54.640
<b>Even then, this is too...</b>

06:54.640 --> 06:57.390
<b><i>Everything is for the victory of humanity.</i></b>

06:57.770 --> 07:03.440
<b><i>Those in our position must make
decisions with things in perspective.</i></b>

07:04.320 --> 07:08.490
<b>Even if many sacrifices
are necessary for that purpose?</b>

07:08.650 --> 07:15.280
<b><i>That's right. And you are already
in the same position as we are.</i></b>

07:16.740 --> 07:19.250
<b><i>Glory to mankind.</i></b>

07:21.420 --> 07:23.630
<b>Glory to mankind.</b>

07:31.300 --> 07:32.380
<b><i>Commander.</i></b>

07:32.760 --> 07:33.840
<b>What is it?</b>

07:34.180 --> 07:37.180
<b><i>I was able to establish communication
with 2B and 9S.</i></b>

07:37.180 --> 07:40.520
<b><i>May I brief them of the mission details
that had been planned?</i></b>

07:41.480 --> 07:42.520
<b>Yes.</b>

07:50.610 --> 07:55.070
<b>This sunny weather sure makes you sleepy.
Why don’t we sleep for a little bit?</b>

07:55.070 --> 07:56.370
<b>There is no need.</b>

07:56.950 --> 08:00.910
<b>Humans in the past
used to take something called naps.</b>

08:01.620 --> 08:06.130
<b>Sleeping when it wasn't necessary...
Humans are so interesting.</b>

08:09.090 --> 08:10.050
<b>What's that?</b>

08:10.050 --> 08:13.130
<b>Oh, right. You've never
seen one before, huh?</b>

08:13.260 --> 08:18.810
<b>They're launching supplies from Earth
to the Bunker and the human base on the moon.</b>

08:19.310 --> 08:22.810
<b>After all, there are no parts or fuel
in outer space.</b>

08:22.810 --> 08:23.810
<b>I see.</b>

08:25.400 --> 08:31.780
<b>Why don't machine lifeforms, or the aliens
who created them, directly attack the Bunker?</b>

08:32.030 --> 08:34.360
<b>They must have come
from outer space to begin with.</b>

08:34.360 --> 08:37.990
<b>I don't quite understand how aliens think.</b>

08:39.330 --> 08:43.330
<b><i>Operator 21O to 9S and 2B.</i></b>

08:43.330 --> 08:44.210
<b>Yes, yes?</b>

08:44.420 --> 08:48.340
<b><i>A recon request from the commander.
I will now play the message.</i></b>

08:48.880 --> 08:53.510
<b><i>We have confirmed multiple machine lifeforms
that have shown an amicable reaction.</i></b>

08:53.510 --> 08:57.850
<b><i>The YoRHa Soldier who went to investigate
left an incomprehensible final vocal message,</i></b>

08:57.850 --> 08:59.470
<b><i>and then severed comms.</i></b>

09:01.930 --> 09:05.480
<b><i>Oh, what an amusing stage...</i></b>

09:06.400 --> 09:08.400
<b>What does this mean?</b>

09:08.400 --> 09:09.610
<b>Who knows?</b>

09:09.730 --> 09:15.450
<b><i>As the black box signal can still be confirmed,
we assume that she has not died yet.</i></b>

09:15.740 --> 09:18.740
<b><i>We have narrowed down the point
where the signal is originating.</i></b>

09:18.950 --> 09:21.830
<b><i>I order the two of you
to investigate this case.</i></b>

09:21.910 --> 09:26.370
<b><i>Also, the special machine lifeform
in your report is still under investigation.</i></b>

09:26.580 --> 09:29.500
<b><i>We will contact you
when we gain new information.</i></b>

09:29.500 --> 09:31.960
<b><i>That concludes the communication.</i></b>

09:32.840 --> 09:36.630
<b>A missing solder. That's worrisome.</b>

09:38.010 --> 09:38.930
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:42.100 --> 09:45.890
<b>I heard that in the past, YoRHa and Resistance
did not get along.</b>

09:46.520 --> 09:47.900
<b>Do you know anything about that?</b>

09:47.900 --> 09:48.900
<b>No.</b>

09:49.190 --> 09:51.270
<b>Do you know anything, Pod?</b>

09:51.270 --> 09:55.280
<b><i>The relationship with the Resistance
is filed in a record categorized as Access Denied.</i></b>

09:55.280 --> 09:56.530
<b><i>Cannot answer.</i></b>

09:57.780 --> 10:00.820
<b>It's likely some faction war or something.</b>

10:00.820 --> 10:03.830
<b>They didn't have to resemble humans
in that aspect.</b>

10:04.080 --> 10:07.580
<b>- Work is best done peacefully, on friendly terms...
- It's best done quietly.</b>

10:08.750 --> 10:10.040
<b>Okay.</b>

10:28.850 --> 10:32.400
<b>AMUSEMENT PARK</b>

10:31.610 --> 10:32.400
<b>This is...</b>

10:32.770 --> 10:33.820
<b>the target location?</b>

10:33.820 --> 10:35.110
<b>Looks like it.</b>

10:47.830 --> 10:50.540
<b><i>Fun. Fun.</i></b>

10:50.790 --> 10:53.540
<b><i>Fun. Fun.</i></b>

10:53.710 --> 10:56.590
<b><i>Joy. Share.</i></b>

10:56.590 --> 10:58.340
<b>They're not attacking us?</b>

10:58.340 --> 11:02.550
<b>Are these the friendly machine lifeforms
they mentioned in the report?</b>

11:08.310 --> 11:12.480
<b><i>Soon, fun stage will begin.</i></b>

11:12.480 --> 11:15.570
<b>Could it be the location that was reported
in the voice message?</b>

11:20.400 --> 11:25.120
<b><i>Report. Faint black box signal detected.</i></b>

11:26.620 --> 11:29.210
<b>Looks like that's the place.</b>

11:31.580 --> 11:36.550
<b><i>Report. Multiple android signals
detected beyond this door.</i></b>

11:45.970 --> 11:47.180
<b>What is this place?</b>

11:54.770 --> 11:58.610
<b><i>Oh, what beautiful moonlight.</i></b>

11:58.730 --> 12:03.320
<b><i>Please be careful.
The moon can drive men insane.</i></b>

12:03.320 --> 12:07.950
<b><i>I am already insane,
thanks to an anomaly called love.</i></b>

12:10.000 --> 12:13.830
<b>What in the world
are those machine lifeforms doing?</b>

12:13.830 --> 12:18.420
<b><i>A play. Drawing out
human life atop a stage.</i></b>

12:18.420 --> 12:23.130
<b>Human life? They're machine lifeforms.
How ludicrous.</b>

12:23.550 --> 12:25.890
<b><i>Oh. It's the twelve o'clock bell.</i></b>

12:26.100 --> 12:27.640
<b><i>Prince.</i></b>

12:27.850 --> 12:32.020
<b><i>Lady Songstress.</i></b>

12:29.970 --> 12:31.180
<b>What’s going on?</b>

13:03.720 --> 13:05.130
<b>What is this?</b>

13:05.130 --> 13:08.050
<b><i>No similar type data available
in past combat records.</i></b>

13:08.430 --> 13:09.810
<b>It's a mutated unit.</b>

13:10.970 --> 13:12.390
<b>Pod. Covering fire.</b>

13:12.390 --> 13:13.560
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

13:28.280 --> 13:29.450
<b>What is it doing?</b>

13:33.450 --> 13:34.410
<b>2B!</b>

13:34.410 --> 13:36.120
<b>We should retreat for now!</b>

13:40.380 --> 13:41.420
<b>Copy that.</b>

13:44.010 --> 13:49.600
<b><i>Report. Due to enemy electromagnetic waves,
retreat from this combat area is not possible.</i></b>

14:01.190 --> 14:03.400
<b>It’s disadvantageous
to keep fighting like this.</b>

14:03.400 --> 14:04.940
<b>I can hack in and...</b>

14:05.240 --> 14:07.610
<b>Is the enemy hacking us?</b>

14:09.620 --> 14:13.450
<b><i>Must become beautiful.
Put on many adornments.</i></b>

14:14.160 --> 14:16.210
<b><i>I will become beautiful.</i></b>

14:19.250 --> 14:20.170
<b>2B.</b>

14:20.250 --> 14:22.500
<b>It's nothing serious. More importantly...</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:24.380
<b>The "many adornments"?</b>

14:26.720 --> 14:28.010
<b>The enemy’s behavior...</b>

14:35.060 --> 14:35.930
<b>The core.</b>

14:35.930 --> 14:37.060
<b>If we can destroy that...</b>

14:38.140 --> 14:41.190
<b><i>I will. I will...</i></b>

14:41.730 --> 14:47.700
<b><i>become more and more beautiful.</i></b>

14:50.780 --> 14:53.410
<b>Are these android corpses?</b>

14:55.540 --> 14:57.830
<b>Is it repurposing the corpses to attack?</b>

14:58.120 --> 14:59.210
<b>No, this is...</b>

14:59.750 --> 15:02.330
<b>Black box signals have been confirmed.</b>

15:02.330 --> 15:05.130
<b>They've been altered into weapons
while still alive.</b>

15:05.670 --> 15:07.460
<b><i>Proposal. Retreat.</i></b>

15:07.460 --> 15:08.970
<b>I will end this here.</b>

15:18.680 --> 15:19.980
<b>I’ll hack into it.</b>

15:20.100 --> 15:21.230
<b>Please cover for me.</b>

15:21.230 --> 15:22.230
<b>Roger.</b>

15:36.040 --> 15:37.200
<b>This place...</b>

15:45.000 --> 15:46.000
<b><i>Hey.</i></b>

15:46.500 --> 15:48.800
<b><i>Am I beautiful?</i></b>

15:48.800 --> 15:50.510
<b>This is like emotions...</b>

15:50.510 --> 15:51.590
<b><i>Hey.</i></b>

15:51.800 --> 15:52.720
<b><i>Beautiful?</i></b>

15:53.720 --> 15:57.310
<b><i>- Am I beautiful? Am I beautiful? Am I beautiful?
- Help me. Help me.</i></b>

15:57.430 --> 15:59.100
<b><i>Am I beautiful? Am I beautiful?</i></b>

15:57.680 --> 15:58.680
<b>What in the world...</b>

15:59.100 --> 16:00.940
<b><i>Hey, am I beautiful?</i></b>

16:01.850 --> 16:02.900
<b>Why you...</b>

16:05.150 --> 16:06.480
<b><i>More.</i></b>

16:07.190 --> 16:09.360
<b><i>And more.</i></b>

16:10.820 --> 16:14.410
<b><i>Beautiful.</i></b>

16:15.740 --> 16:18.660
<b><i>Someone. Someone help me.</i></b>

16:19.160 --> 16:21.370
<b><i>No. No.</i></b>

16:22.250 --> 16:25.670
<b><i>No, no, no, no.</i></b>

16:25.830 --> 16:29.300
<b><i>No, no, no, no.</i></b>

16:26.790 --> 16:30.380
<b><i>Alert. Saturation attack triggered
by enemy consciousness data.</i></b>

16:30.380 --> 16:33.010
<b><i>Possibility of immense damage
to memory sector.</i></b>

16:33.010 --> 16:34.220
<b>9S.</b>

16:41.180 --> 16:42.430
<b><i>I...</i></b>

16:42.980 --> 16:44.140
<b><i>love you.</i></b>

16:44.440 --> 16:45.810
<b><i>I really...</i></b>

16:46.150 --> 16:47.150
<b><i>love you.</i></b>

16:47.400 --> 16:48.940
<b>Just die...</b>

16:48.940 --> 16:50.190
<b>already!</b>

17:06.130 --> 17:07.380
<b>Let go.</b>

17:07.380 --> 17:08.840
<b><i>This is also bad.</i></b>

17:08.960 --> 17:10.420
<b><i>This is also bad.</i></b>

17:10.750 --> 17:12.510
<b><i>This too. This is also bad.</i></b>

17:13.510 --> 17:16.470
<b><i>This is also bad. This is also bad.</i></b>

17:16.760 --> 17:19.970
<b><i>This is also bad. This is also bad.</i></b>

17:20.100 --> 17:21.720
<b><i>I'm sick of this.</i></b>

17:25.270 --> 17:28.230
<b><i>Help. Kill me. Kill me.</i></b>

17:27.730 --> 17:29.980
<b>Stop it...</b>

17:28.230 --> 17:32.190
<b><i>For his sake. For his...</i></b>

17:32.530 --> 17:34.610
<b><i>...sake.</i></b>

17:48.580 --> 17:51.550
<b><i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry.</i></b>

17:51.630 --> 17:54.590
<b><i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry.</i></b>

17:55.050 --> 17:58.180
<b><i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry.</i></b>

17:59.680 --> 18:04.730
<b><i>Alert. Enemy consciousness is running wild
and trying to assimilate 9S.</i></b>

18:07.350 --> 18:12.110
<b>Pod. Utilize emergency usage
of my hacking attacks to the enemy.</b>

18:12.110 --> 18:13.610
<b><i>Inadvisable.</i></b>

18:13.690 --> 18:18.490
<b><i>Hacking done by Type B models have
the possibility of logic corruption. Unsuitable.</i></b>

18:15.190 --> 18:18.490
<b>Give me a bypass to 9S.
Just hurry up and do it!</b>

18:18.780 --> 18:22.330
<b><i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry.</i></b>

18:26.080 --> 18:28.250
<b>Damn it.</b>

18:31.590 --> 18:32.670
<b>2B!</b>

18:33.250 --> 18:34.670
<b>Why are you here?</b>

18:33.880 --> 18:35.340
<b><i>That’s mine.</i></b>

18:35.710 --> 18:39.640
<b><i>Give it back to me.</i></b>

18:39.840 --> 18:41.390
<b>There you are.</b>

19:00.070 --> 19:01.070
<b>Pod!</b>

19:01.070 --> 19:02.240
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

19:03.660 --> 19:04.700
<b>Go!</b>

19:09.750 --> 19:13.040
<b><i>I... became beautiful.</i></b>

19:23.430 --> 19:24.510
<b>2B!</b>

19:30.230 --> 19:33.730
<b>Thank you very much
for saving me just now.</b>

19:33.900 --> 19:36.070
<b>But to do something
as reckless as hacking...</b>

19:36.070 --> 19:38.780
<b>Don't worry about it. I'm fine.</b>

19:39.780 --> 19:40.740
<b>What's that?</b>

19:42.660 --> 19:46.160
<b>This crystal...
Is it the machine lifeform's core?</b>

19:46.240 --> 19:50.580
<b><i>Analysis. It is a fragment of the core
from the machine lifeform.</i></b>

19:50.580 --> 19:53.920
<b><i>Structurally similar to a plant cell.</i></b>

19:53.920 --> 19:56.000
<b>Plant cell?</b>

19:56.800 --> 20:00.050
<b>This machine lifeform
was saying strange things.</b>

20:00.760 --> 20:01.970
<b>It was like emotions were...</b>

20:01.970 --> 20:05.850
<b>Such things don't exist
for machine lifeforms.</b>

20:09.270 --> 20:10.100
<b><i>M...</i></b>

20:12.600 --> 20:14.480
<b><i>M... M... </i></b>

20:15.110 --> 20:16.730
<b><i>Mom.</i></b>

20:18.150 --> 20:21.860
<b><i>W-Wait. Please wait.</i></b>

20:22.400 --> 20:27.580
<b><i>Play. We just came
to watch the play. Please.</i></b>

20:27.870 --> 20:32.540
<b><i>Please. Please. Please.</i></b>

20:32.870 --> 20:35.750
<b><i>Please. Please.</i></b>

20:36.090 --> 20:39.130
<b><i>P-Please. Please.</i></b>

20:39.210 --> 20:40.260
<b><i>Not my daughter...</i></b>

21:02.110 --> 21:03.240
<b>You can't hesitate.</b>

21:03.740 --> 21:04.740
<b>2B.</b>

22:40.750 --> 22:43.170
<b>POD 042 REPORTING TO ALL OF MANKIND.</b>

22:40.750 --> 22:43.170
<b>WE WILL NOW EXECUTE THE TASK
OF INTRODUCING THE MULTIPLE ENDINGS
