23:24.300 --> 23:25.300
<b>O-Okay.</b>

23:25.550 --> 23:29.590
<b>Listen up. We YoRHa Soldiers
are the spear of hope for humanity.</b>

23:29.590 --> 23:32.430
<b>Engrave that into your hearts
once again. Got that?</b>

23:32.430 --> 23:33.470
<b>Yessir!</b>

23:34.720 --> 23:37.220
<b>Some YoRHa units abandoned their mission.
